   B2_RW_U07_P202_E4:['<h3>Topic sentences</h3>'+list(1,'I really admire my teacher, Mrs Franklin. '+slot(1,'d'))+list(2,'My parents look after my brother and me. '+slot(2,'c'))+list(3,'Professional footballers have to train every day. '+slot(3,'b'))+list(4,'My uncle is my hero. '+slot(4,'a')),'<h3>Concluding sentences</h3>'+list('a','In conclusion, I admire him a lot.')+list('b','In short, it is difficult to compete against other teams if you don’t practise.')+list('c','In summary, they work hard to make sure we have everything we need.')+list('d','In short, I respect her because she works so hard at the school.')],
